  Wan2.2 — https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2 — Apache-2.0 (licenses/Wan2.2-Apache-2.0.txt)
Models downloaded on first use, not redistributed (Apache-2.0):
  Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512, Wan-AI/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B-Diffusers, Wan-AI/Wan2.2-S2V-14B
shim/gfpgan is a local stub so SadTalker imports without gfpgan/basicsr; no GFPGAN code or weights are used.
Speech audio comes only from the separate tts-local tool (MeloTTS, MIT) over HTTP; no voice cloning and no TTS model is bundled.
LLM (not bundled): OpenAI-compatible API; default deployment Ollama (MIT) serving Google Gemma (see Gemma's terms of use).
Full list with licenses: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

Usage rule: only your own or explicitly consented face; no face swap and no voice cloning is implemented.

